      "what": {
        "kind": "picture",
        "label": "character ann sequence",
        "spec": {
          "id": "ann",
          "kind": "sequence",
          "parts": [
            "dbbf10233d905fe5",
            "Six distinct locked-off views joined by hard cuts. [Shot 1] a full-body shot frames ann, as the clips describe it, the entire figure visible from head to toe, facing the camera, generous empty margin on every side. The figure stands still in a neutral upright pose with arms relaxed at the sides and does not move, walk, gesture or turn at any point, and holds a neutral expression until the final shot. [Shot 2] At 00:00.750, the shot cuts to a tight close-up of the face, framed from the top of the hair to the chin, still facing the camera, the mouth closed and a still neutral expression. [Shot 3] At 00:01.500, the shot cuts to a left side profile of the full figure, the whole body visible from head to toe with the same framing margin, the head turned to show the left profile, the mouth closed and a still neutral expression. [Shot 4] At 00:02.250, the shot cuts to a right side profile of the full figure, the whole body visible from head to toe with the same framing margin, the head turned to show the right profile, the mouth closed and a still neutral expression. [Shot 5] At 00:03.000, the shot cuts to a rear view of the full figure, the back of the body visible from head to toe with the same framing margin, the mouth closed and a still neutral expression. [Shot 6] At 00:03.750, the shot cuts to a medium close-up of the face and shoulders, still facing the camera, the expression now angry: brows lowered and drawn together, eyes narrowed, jaw clenched, lips pressed tight. Only the expression changes; the figure does not flinch, recoil, turn away or move. Plain seamless neutral grey studio backdrop, even neutral lighting from every side, no props and no cast shadows. Clothing, hair, colours, proportions and every visible detail remain identical across every shot.",
            "h3-sequence-to-sheet",
          ],
        },
        "workflow": "h3-sequence-to-sheet",
      },
